<p data-lake-id="ubf7556ad" id="ubf7556ad"><span data-lake-id="u76ccaeca-html-part-1" id="u76ccaeca-html-part-1">这是一篇可以直接用语雀顶栏「复制为 Markdown 格式」复制的样本。正文用同一组虚构读数串起各种块，方便在复制结果里找回原位置。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id="Ug7P1" id="Ug7P1"><span data-lake-id="u9da94d8f-html-part-1" id="u9da94d8f-html-part-1">一、标题与正文</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u21959c82" id="u21959c82"><span data-lake-id="u7ee8f857-html-part-1" id="u7ee8f857-html-part-1">普通段落：今天记录两次读数，上午为 18.5，下午为 21.0。第二句含中文标点、English words、百分号 50% 和 emoji </span><span data-lake-id="uf97ba13c-html-part-1" id="uf97ba13c-html-part-1">🌱</span><span data-lake-id="u74bfdc98-html-part-1" id="u74bfdc98-html-part-1">。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="AdZgf" id="AdZgf"><span data-lake-id="ua5745f9a-html-part-1" id="ua5745f9a-html-part-1">二级标题：采样地点</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id="DgSQ5" id="DgSQ5"><span data-lake-id="ub594c199-html-part-1" id="ub594c199-html-part-1">三级标题：窗边</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id="en03L" id="en03L"><span data-lake-id="uc5c4c074-html-part-1" id="uc5c4c074-html-part-1">四级标题：仪器 A</span></h4><h5 data-lake-id="eZlV2" id="eZlV2"><span data-lake-id="u09304d06-html-part-1" id="u09304d06-html-part-1">五级标题：刻度</span></h5><h6 data-lake-id="gDUe6" id="gDUe6"><span data-lake-id="u70890c3e-html-part-1" id="u70890c3e-html-part-1">六级标题：读数单位</span></h6><p data-lake-id="u5dc227a5" id="u5dc227a5"><span data-lake-id="ue27bb1ae-html-part-1" id="ue27bb1ae-html-part-1">第一段的末尾是「甲」。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ufed105c0" id="ufed105c0"><span data-lake-id="ud31d4db4-html-part-1" id="ud31d4db4-html-part-1">第二段的开头是「乙」。同一段内的第一行到这里。</span><span data-lake-id="u6521c485-html-part-1" id="u6521c485-html-part-1"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="u18789051-html-part-1" id="u18789051-html-part-1">这是手动换行后的第二行。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="QkVfv" id="QkVfv"><span data-lake-id="uef2e2589-html-part-1" id="uef2e2589-html-part-1">二、行内格式</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u892d5009" id="u892d5009"><span data-lake-id="uf954b0a0-html-part-1" id="uf954b0a0-html-part-1">常规文字、</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u93d5eabd-html-part-1" id="u93d5eabd-html-part-1">粗体</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4501a8b5-html-part-1" id="u4501a8b5-html-part-1">、</span><em><span data-lake-id="u14d32e3e-html-part-1" id="u14d32e3e-html-part-1">斜体</span></em><span data-lake-id="u639b3da0-html-part-1" id="u639b3da0-html-part-1">、</span><em><strong><span data-lake-id="uba2b08cc-html-part-1" id="uba2b08cc-html-part-1">粗斜体</span></strong></em><span data-lake-id="ud93d4183-html-part-1" id="ud93d4183-html-part-1">、</span><del><span data-lake-id="ufe00887d-html-part-1" id="ufe00887d-html-part-1">已作废</span></del><span data-lake-id="u200d10e1-html-part-1" id="u200d10e1-html-part-1">、</span><code data-lake-id="u9493122e" id="u9493122e"><span data-lake-id="u7c13b3c5-html-part-1" id="u7c13b3c5-html-part-1">sensor_id</span></code><span data-lake-id="ud4a3b9cf-html-part-1" id="ud4a3b9cf-html-part-1">，以及</span><a href="https://yuque.example.com/example.user/book01" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u2d02386e" id="u2d02386e"><span data-lake-id="u4a4c57ff-html-part-1" id="u4a4c57ff-html-part-1">回到原初个人知识库</span></a><span data-lake-id="u0b79b552-html-part-1" id="u0b79b552-html-part-1">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uae0f1a02" id="uae0f1a02"><span data-lake-id="u258473bf-html-part-1" id="u258473bf-html-part-1">组合样本：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufbff593a-html-part-1" id="ufbff593a-html-part-1">起点 </span></strong><code data-lake-id="ufd88e270" id="ufd88e270"><span data-lake-id="u74ef3ad3-html-part-1" id="u74ef3ad3-html-part-1">A-01</span></code><strong><span data-lake-id="udd3771fb-html-part-1" id="udd3771fb-html-part-1"> 与终点</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u96e40aae-html-part-1" id="u96e40aae-html-part-1">，链接后面紧接中文标点。字面字符样本：</span><span data-lake-id="uf1cfe2f1-html-part-1" id="uf1cfe2f1-html-part-1">*</span><span data-lake-id="ud2c27307-html-part-1" id="ud2c27307-html-part-1">星号</span><span data-lake-id="uab05e9d6-html-part-1" id="uab05e9d6-html-part-1">*</span><span data-lake-id="u2995f9c6-html-part-1" id="u2995f9c6-html-part-1">、</span><span data-lake-id="u45131916-html-part-1" id="u45131916-html-part-1">[</span><span data-lake-id="ua6a9e8ec-html-part-1" id="ua6a9e8ec-html-part-1">方括号</span><span data-lake-id="u67107f20-html-part-1" id="u67107f20-html-part-1">]</span><span data-lake-id="ua61ff918-html-part-1" id="ua61ff918-html-part-1">、</span><code data-lake-id="u50ed37ec" id="u50ed37ec"><span data-lake-id="ubf966ec1-html-part-1" id="ubf966ec1-html-part-1">a | b</span></code><span data-lake-id="uc3afbc1d-html-part-1" id="uc3afbc1d-html-part-1">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u80dbbe04" id="u80dbbe04"><span data-lake-id="u3d9fd723-html-part-1" id="u3d9fd723-html-part-1">富文本样本：</span><u><span data-lake-id="u4244805a" id="u4244805a">下划线</span></u><span data-lake-id="u3d9fd723-html-part-2" id="u3d9fd723-html-part-2">、H</span><sub><span data-lake-id="u9ee7c274" id="u9ee7c274">2</span></sub><span data-lake-id="u3d9fd723-html-part-3" id="u3d9fd723-html-part-3">O、m</span><sup><span data-lake-id="u3181c553" id="u3181c553">2</span></sup><span data-lake-id="u3d9fd723-html-part-4" id="u3d9fd723-html-part-4">、</span><span data-lake-id="u9d08351c" id="u9d08351c" style="color: rgb(216,57,49)">红色文字</span><span data-lake-id="u3d9fd723-html-part-5" id="u3d9fd723-html-part-5">、</span><span data-lake-id="u9bd43cac" id="u9bd43cac" style="background-color: rgb(255,241,184)">黄色高亮</span><span data-lake-id="u3d9fd723-html-part-6" id="u3d9fd723-html-part-6">。</span></p><card type="block" name="hr" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Xlkc8%22%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="CWp69" id="CWp69"><span data-lake-id="udc000470-html-part-1" id="udc000470-html-part-1">三、列表和任务</span></h2><ul list="u02a24114"><li fid="u9f249013" data-lake-id="ubded0739" id="ubded0739"><span data-lake-id="u76d92418-html-part-1" id="u76d92418-html-part-1">温度计</span></li></ul><ul list="ueceb30b7" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u4a314569" data-lake-id="u14e66b7e" id="u14e66b7e"><span data-lake-id="uee0797f6-html-part-1" id="uee0797f6-html-part-1">玻璃温度计</span></li></ul><ul list="uf90c1eb1" start="2" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u929992f0" data-lake-id="u34fc7554" id="u34fc7554"><span data-lake-id="u06884d74-html-part-1" id="u06884d74-html-part-1">电子温度计</span></li></ul><ul list="u0844ee08" data-lake-indent="2"><li fid="u296af5d4" data-lake-id="ud705be7f" id="ud705be7f"><span data-lake-id="u6adeb299-html-part-1" id="u6adeb299-html-part-1">型号 </span><code data-lake-id="uefe5c145" id="uefe5c145"><span data-lake-id="ua4824b0b-html-part-1" id="ua4824b0b-html-part-1">T-01</span></code></li></ul><ul list="u5fa61f7e" start="2"><li fid="u5108b75d" data-lake-id="uda9d5f09" id="uda9d5f09"><span data-lake-id="u8f9a3606-html-part-1" id="u8f9a3606-html-part-1">计时器</span></li></ul><ol list="ud2c80902"><li fid="u238535f6" data-lake-id="u433e1acd" id="u433e1acd"><span data-lake-id="u42f6360b-html-part-1" id="u42f6360b-html-part-1">记录初值。</span></li></ol><ol list="u258627d9" start="2"><li fid="u56db2ba9" data-lake-id="u0e4dca42" id="u0e4dca42"><span data-lake-id="u7b5c813d-html-part-1" id="u7b5c813d-html-part-1">复测两次。</span></li></ol><ul list="u94fda8e9" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u1b9fa9b1" data-lake-id="ua1dbdbb1" id="ua1dbdbb1"><span data-lake-id="u40fc1760-html-part-1" id="u40fc1760-html-part-1">第一次读数 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uba21f3c8-html-part-1" id="uba21f3c8-html-part-1">18.5</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub773b0c7-html-part-1" id="ub773b0c7-html-part-1">。</span></li></ul><ul list="u80805dc1" start="2" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u4ca04c07" data-lake-id="ua2f73894" id="ua2f73894"><span data-lake-id="uc05ba98d-html-part-1" id="uc05ba98d-html-part-1">第二次读数 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4f26f0c0-html-part-1" id="u4f26f0c0-html-part-1">18.7</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u83e93f59-html-part-1" id="u83e93f59-html-part-1">。</span></li></ul><ol list="ubf3c9b7a" start="3"><li fid="u99979644" data-lake-id="ue337ba63" id="ue337ba63"><span data-lake-id="u46f0697e-html-part-1" id="u46f0697e-html-part-1">写下平均值。</span></li></ol><ul list="u2e4fb3c8" class="lake-list"><li fid="u9c8a93fc" data-lake-id="u5f395a0d" id="u5f395a0d" class="lake-list-node lake-list-task"><card type="inline" name="checkbox" value="data:true"></card><span data-lake-id="u83e090da-html-part-1" id="u83e090da-html-part-1">上午读数已登记</span></li></ul><ul list="ub283ed8a" start="2" class="lake-list"><li fid="u156a26af" data-lake-id="u52de85bf" id="u52de85bf" class="lake-list-node lake-list-task"><card type="inline" name="checkbox" value="data:false"></card><span data-lake-id="u67dec536-html-part-1" id="u67dec536-html-part-1">下午读数待复核</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="qr7RZ" id="qr7RZ"><span data-lake-id="u0e9b0693-html-part-1" id="u0e9b0693-html-part-1">四、引用与提示</span></h2><blockquote data-lake-id="u598219ee" id="u598219ee"><p data-lake-id="ud1303c54" id="ud1303c54"><span data-lake-id="u67e6b035-html-part-1" id="u67e6b035-html-part-1">来自记录本：每次采样前，先让仪器静置一分钟。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6fed4bfe" id="u6fed4bfe"><span data-lake-id="uaa7fe3f6-html-part-1" id="uaa7fe3f6-html-part-1">引用中的第二段含 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u709785cc-html-part-1" id="u709785cc-html-part-1">重点</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u07b9bc14-html-part-1" id="u07b9bc14-html-part-1"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id="uc774ed15" id="uc774ed15"><span data-lake-id="u88a38f3b-html-part-1" id="u88a38f3b-html-part-1">60s</span></code><span data-lake-id="u251f3567-html-part-1" id="u251f3567-html-part-1">。</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id="u362de3b8" id="u362de3b8"><span data-lake-id="uf70568d7-html-part-1" id="uf70568d7-html-part-1">引用结束，这句话是普通正文。</span></p><blockquote data-lake-id="yfm-callout-2-1" id="yfm-callout-2-1" class="lake-alert lake-alert-info"><p data-lake-id="ub4712952" id="ub4712952"><span data-lake-id="u3f263760" id="u3f263760">提示框：蓝色标签代表上午批次，绿色标签代表下午批次。</span></p></blockquote><h2 data-lake-id="UG917" id="UG917"><span data-lake-id="ud98143bf" id="ud98143bf">五、代码与公式</span></h2><p data-